post-it: Computer doesn't start
cause: Parts in the wrong places
symptoms:
	No picture at all
	Stops before Windows starts
	No sound
checks:
	no: Windows starts
	no: Shows a picture at power-on
	no: Stops at "Non-System disk or disk error"
	no: Every part sits in its own place
	yes: Fans run but no picture
	no: CPU is in its socket
		shows: in the Workview
hardware steps:
	Open case
	Put each part in its own slot
	Fit any missing part
	Close case
notes:
	Broken part: All hardware are in the wrong places
